---
source: crates/foreman-core/tests/rules.rs
expression: "rows.join(\"\\n\")"
---
yes yes → & yes | yes
yes no → & no | yes
yes undecided → & undecided | yes
no yes → & no | yes
no no → & no | no
no undecided → & no | undecided
undecided yes → & undecided | yes
undecided no → & no | undecided
undecided undecided → & undecided | undecided
